00:05:17,647 --> 00:05:23,647
Christmas Belle is a drama, romance, tv movie film directed by Alex Wright.

2
00:10:35,294 --> 00:10:41,294
With her California hometown in the rearview mirror, Belle heads north
on business to catalog the sale of a large mansion.

3
00:15:52,941 --> 00:15:58,941
While the job is a dream, the client, Hunter Lowell, is not.

4
00:21:10,588 --> 00:21:16,588
But, as the two spend more time together, his icy demeanor begins to melt.

5
00:26:28,235 --> 00:26:34,235
Although their relationship is budding, Belle’s long-time suitor, Tony, arrives,
sending mixed signals to Hunter while adding chaos to the holiday season.

6
00:31:45,882 --> 00:31:51,882
Isabella Everhart, played by Haylie Duff.

7
00:37:03,529 --> 00:37:09,529
Hunter Lowell, played by Nicholas Gonzalez.

8
00:42:21,176 --> 00:42:27,176
Tony, played by Mark Famiglietti.

9
00:47:38,823 --> 00:47:44,823
Rex Everhart, played by C. Thomas Howell.

10
00:52:56,470 --> 00:53:02,470
Angie, played by Sheree J. Wilson.

11
00:58:14,117 --> 00:58:20,117
Burny, played by Jerry Hauck.

