01:03:31,764 --> 01:03:37,764
Beauty and the Beast: The Enchanted Christmas is a 1997 direct-to-video animated Christmas musical fantasy film produced by Walt Disney
Television Animation and Disneytoon Studios, as a sequel to Disney's 1991 animated feature film Beauty and the Beast.

13
01:08:49,411 --> 01:08:55,411
The film was released by Walt Disney Home Video on November 11, 1997.

14
01:14:07,058 --> 01:14:13,058
While a frame story is set after the events of the original film, the main narrative is
a flashback recounting Belle and the Beast's first Christmas together.

15
01:19:24,705 --> 01:19:30,705
The film sold 7.6 million VHS tapes in 1997.

16
01:24:42,352 --> 01:24:48,352
The tone is emotional.
